    "title": "Is a draft coming? Do women have to sign up for selective service?",
    "text": "NEWSWho can be drafted? Age range for draft. How does draft work? Maria FrancisUSA TODAY NETWORKMarch 14, 2026, 9:27 a.m. ETAmid the continuing war in Iran and White House Press Secretary's comments about a possible military draft, many are questioning their registration status for the Selective Service, including women, and how it works. Here's the who, how and what to know about getting drafted in the US.During a Fox News interview on March 8, Maria Bartiromo expressed \"Mothers out there are worried that we're gonna have a draft, that they're going to see their sons and daughters get involved in this,\" and asked White House Press Secretary Karoline Leavitt \"What do you wanna say about the president's plan for troops on the ground?\" To which Leavitt admitted the president is not ruling out American troops on the ground in Iran or a military draft.",
